  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given:&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>B</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>B</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;</p><p>We have,&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Simplifying we get&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></math></p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>cos</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></math></p>"
  }
